{{Nihongo|'''Takamaicán'''|タカマイカン|Takamaikan|lead=yes|}}, alternatively known as '''Little Takamaiku''' ({{lang-bl|Piqueño Takamaicá}}), is an [[w:Ethnic enclave|ethnic enclave]] in [[Castejón]]'s [[Coruxón]] borough, and the largest [[Takamaikan Baliscans|Takamaikan]] [[w:ethnic enclave|enclave]] outside of [[w:Asia|Asia]]. 

